      "content": "reaching out to people just feels like opening the cage door to a pack of wolves. i can't go back to that. i spent years making sure i was untouchable, and now i'm just stuck in this hollow space where nothing happens and nothing matters. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen but i know nothing will. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a room that's already empty.",
